testdata/upstream holds test frames from facebook/zstd's tests/golden-decompression
and tests/golden-decompression-errors, at commit
49cf51799ea051457f57243527aa2058f999f005, and src/vectors_wbtest.mbt embeds
them. They are used under facebook/zstd's BSD license, testdata/upstream/LICENSE:

  Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates. All rights reserved.

src/params.mbt transcribes the compression parameters of levels 1 to 12 from
facebook/zstd v1.5.7, lib/compress/clevels.h (ZSTD_defaultCParameters), under
the same BSD license.

src/internal/match/fast.mbt uses the hash constants and recent-offset
search ordering of facebook/zstd v1.5.7, lib/compress/zstd_fast.c and
zstd_compress_internal.h, under that BSD license. It is a scalar MoonBit
implementation with bounded rebased positions, rather than the reference's
pipelined pointer loop.

src/internal/match/dfast.mbt transcribes the no-dictionary double-fast
search loop and hash constants of facebook/zstd v1.5.7,
lib/compress/zstd_double_fast.c and zstd_compress_internal.h, under the
same BSD license. Pointer lookahead uses checked rebased positions.
